        },
        {
          "text": "U-Abishayi umfowabo kaJowabe indodana kaSeruya wayeyinhloko yabathathu. Yena waphakamisela abangamakhulu amathathu umkhonto wakhe, wababulala, waba negama phakathi kwabathathu.",
