              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayengadunyiswa kakhulu kunabathathu na? ngakho-ke wayengumbusi wabo; kodwa akafinyelelanga kwabathathu bokuqala.",
