              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBenaya, indodana kaJehoyada, indodana yendoda enesibindi, waseKabiseyeli, owenza izenzo eziningi, wabulala abantu ababili bakwaMowabi abanjengezingonyama;",
