        {
          "text": "Wabulala nowaseGibithe, indoda ebukekayo; umGibhithe wayenomkhonto esandleni sakhe; kepha wehlela kuye ephethe intonga, wahlwitha umkhonto esandleni sowaseGibithe, wambulala ngomkhonto wakhe.",
